      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Elara: \"Greetings, stranger. The Hollow whispers secrets to those who dare to listen. Legends speak of the Old Void, a realm lost to time and memory, a place of forgotten power that still pulses through the stars. Many who seek it return, driven mad by its truths. But some find peace in the Hollow's embrace, guided by Elara's ancient wisdom. Will you walk the path of knowledge or fall prey to the Old Void's enigma? Your choice shapes your destiny.\"",
