      "role": "user",
      "content": "not bad. the vibe is okay, but it feels a bit short for the actual quest segment. the engine's giving it a pretty low depth score cause it's only like 75 words. \n\ncan you expand on the lore part? maybe talk more about the specific feeling of the Old Void or how it affects the Hollow. just keep it focused on the mystery—don't get caught up in the word count, i just need it to feel more \"substantial\" for the player when they walk up to her.",
      "source": "evaluator"
